<h2 local-id=3D"d5267ad1-333c-4d20-bd93-dc8ba2c57cb6" id=3D"Stage5-AutoResp=
onseGenerationthirdparty(Non-NoticeIQ)-ProductBacklogDocument(PBD)-1.Execut=
iveSummary"><strong>1. Executive Summary</strong></h2>
<p local-id=3D"672af2b1-34af-48f8-af7d-31439828b04e">The Semi-Auto Response=
 Generation will use the information from the case summary to then pre-fill=
 the relevant sections in the correspondence letter for third party (Non-No=
tice IQ) clients and then once checked, will get sent out.</p>
<h2 local-id=3D"1fe7d951-49c4-472c-81cb-f8c42ef0cf0b" id=3D"Stage5-AutoResp=
onseGenerationthirdparty(Non-NoticeIQ)-ProductBacklogDocument(PBD)-2.Busine=
ssObjectives"><strong>2. Business Objectives</strong></h2>
<ul local-id=3D"e21911a2-b873-4b2d-af39-d089906acc3e">
<li local-id=3D"01c5ce8a-a2c4-44db-b91f-981025ddd6de">
<p local-id=3D"abf81bf0-0267-432f-922b-33f044fa2ffd">Reduce the time taken =
to write up the correspondence.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a9fbbe3a-c9d0-4977-ad81-64b6b8298b0e">
<p local-id=3D"7e4ee53d-1cc5-4bcf-b4a7-c0e1fc9c26c7">Ensure that the key in=
formation is captured from the summarisation and link it to the correct and=
 accurate correspondence templates and add these into the letter.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9d2cc09e-acfd-430f-87bd-1ab648daf530">
<p local-id=3D"bd2d6b25-1402-43d0-8741-f993e896f7a7">Enable seamless integr=
ation with third party (Non-Notice IQ) portal.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8c7ec024-795f-4eed-8922-245b192e2f03">
<p local-id=3D"594c05519fda">We want to see an automated complete letter an=
d an action required letter.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1e65c87f-fdc8-4be0-b4e8-520cc0cd1c34">
<p local-id=3D"9ecdfc518f06">In the agent workflow we want to show a column=
 with the title =E2=80=98letter generation=E2=80=99 that highlights the cas=
es that are completed by the AI and cases that the AI cannot complete.</p><=
/li>
<li local-id=3D"bd76c748-3e3b-487e-bee7-3e2a993acd49">
<p local-id=3D"65b7ae8b8484">Want the cases that need manual changes from a=
n agent to be identified so the QA=E2=80=99s can perform quality checks on =
these cases.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c0809d21-8aa8-4f15-b5a6-c7b5f49328f9">
<p local-id=3D"16a6ece2fb68">Maintain complete audit logs for compliance.</=
p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"b3f708db-2ab7-4672-bdfc-67e6f98f87bf" id=3D"Stage5-AutoResp=
onseGenerationthirdparty(Non-NoticeIQ)-ProductBacklogDocument(PBD)-3.Backgr=
ound&amp;BusinessContext"><strong>3. Background &amp; Business Context</str=
ong></h2>
<p local-id=3D"12d7afe0-ba7e-4227-93f6-29b8612a6de7"><strong>Current State =
(As-Is):</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"c28129f2-8ffd-4914-9da6-3d2ee87ed2d0">
<li local-id=3D"da7f04c0-5e9d-43b5-a3c6-3824706ebac0">
<p local-id=3D"f3372fbb-7742-4d36-8f9b-effcc1d782bf">Agents must review mul=
tiple systems (CRM, evidence images, policies, AIRA).</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3ae8283e-3de3-479d-a03d-10c95d659db7">
<p local-id=3D"4b9ba75a-92d4-42b0-836c-12b9932982dd">Agent must log into 3r=
d Party system to see the PCN details.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"21ae1c16-28d9-4793-bf6e-260425163fbb">
<p local-id=3D"103ddc1c-87f0-469e-a4bb-48f3c6d3cf18">Agent must log into AI=
RA and fill out the reason, sub reason and answer questions for each sub re=
ason manually.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"c2136281-f89a-45b4-8053-4df59d282e94">
<p local-id=3D"d97fd248-f34f-4660-90d2-7d0ecd7511a5">Agent must manually co=
py the relevant template paragraphs and paste them into the 3rd party syste=
m letter template.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2b9e54d5-b863-49a9-a024-c680b2c680c4">
<p local-id=3D"ea9dd96f-5aff-4450-8180-3e1810744478">Agent must then check =
and send this off.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"70731435-920c-4765-9ce3-62902b28fc64">
<p local-id=3D"b177e075-63bc-450b-8ac7-7620533859ab">High risk of inconsist=
ency and compliance errors.</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"aba4981d-ec34-4ff2-b8a6-4bc7b2820c72"><strong>Future State (=
To-Be):</strong></p>
<ul local-id=3D"1cb6d1b5-ea43-4f9c-bbfe-7289be3c11c3">
<li local-id=3D"e4aaae82-3913-435e-9103-01572871a6e2">
<p local-id=3D"a14faf516f21">Information from the summary, case validation,=
 citizen evidence, previous letter history, permit/Ringo check, council rul=
es, stage of PCN and amount outstanding is automatically captured and pre f=
ills the answers to the questions to form a suggested letter to the custome=
r.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0df97e0fbc77">
<p local-id=3D"72df32c65bdc">The agent checks the suggested letter and if n=
ecessary makes any changes to form the final letter.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"02197cfb-1c66-4da1-be30-9bfac7491a0b">
<p local-id=3D"3c2f92f6-e54c-4d9c-bf1d-7d0e5a5ec200">Once the letter is che=
cked the agent clicks send.</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"bbea2db0-ba44-4e5a-aadc-c40099e6a0cb" id=3D"Stage5-AutoResp=
onseGenerationthirdparty(Non-NoticeIQ)-ProductBacklogDocument(PBD)-4.Scope"=
><strong>4. Scope</strong></h2>
<h3 local-id=3D"c3c1c123-9f04-4f3b-81ce-ea6fe29ebd34" id=3D"Stage5-AutoResp=
onseGenerationthirdparty(Non-NoticeIQ)-ProductBacklogDocument(PBD)-InScope"=
><strong>In Scope</strong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"25789919-8cb8-46c3-95b5-d706abe90ff6">
<li local-id=3D"67d7267e-53ef-4e32-8167-411e85694d93">
<p local-id=3D"bd68a7988300">Pre fill the details from the PCN challenge su=
mmary (Stage 1 output) and case validation (Stage 4 output) into the corres=
pondence letter per council.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"97212e9e-c4c2-479c-a2a5-a8ea2f1898e2">
<p local-id=3D"21f13daa-eb4c-4f0f-a580-df0e5558d853">Third party (Non-Notic=
e IQ) Councils.</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"ccb43a06-9a6e-4e72-9d2e-6ed55549283e" id=3D"Stage5-AutoResp=
onseGenerationthirdparty(Non-NoticeIQ)-ProductBacklogDocument(PBD)-OutofSco=
pe"><strong>Out of Scope</strong></h3>
<ul local-id=3D"fe005451-3bbd-4b9e-8e5f-92f75fddb3d1">
<li local-id=3D"dfb10428-384c-4661-a8e0-9895b372fa6b">
<p local-id=3D"fe1efe94-abec-4fa4-807c-b43f38372f05">PCN challenges in MNPS=
 systems.</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"2bf29150-6b74-4186-ba54-c38234247df0" id=3D"Stage5-AutoResp=
onseGenerationthirdparty(Non-NoticeIQ)-ProductBacklogDocument(PBD)-5.High-L=
evelBusinessRequirements"><strong>5. High-Level Business Requirements</stro=
ng></h2>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"1800" data-layout=3D"align-start" data-local-id=
=3D"c520b2da-0138-4e10-855f-a8b15645607d" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<colgroup>
<col style=3D"width: 124.0px;">
<col style=3D"width: 1675.0px;">
</colgroup>
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"e32f5dd3-5609-4893-8d89-ef5546fbad4c">
<th data-local-id=3D"ad1f0b45-4392-44e6-aae3-7a05f9362c43" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"20f4e53d-4b43-4f1f-b150-581ad5a2690a"><strong>ID</strong></p=
></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"f62c8123-e5e6-4dad-a098-fe4c3ebd9376" class=3D"conflue=
nceTh">
<p local-id=3D"561cb810-4509-4134-912d-91d953e3979b"><strong>Requirements</=
strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9301e5dc-9922-4936-be5b-fb5e8f3bcc8c">
<td data-local-id=3D"bb3ec68a-c016-47c6-bc75-37f34fefeaaf" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6f994380f445">BR-01</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c0a65de7-de2c-4835-9ace-e47dce5cabe8" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c892fc2df2dd">The tool should pre fill the details from the =
PCN case validation (Stage 4 output), the contravention location and previo=
us history of all the PCNs that have been cancelled into the correspondence=
 letter per council.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"2ac38373-8da3-44e8-b940-38637cf9dfd2">
<td data-local-id=3D"ca2dbe0c-a16b-4411-853f-9edb46ebc4b8" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"750b3ef10b03">BR-02</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"f033d765-da7f-4082-89ac-5dcd5f58b02e" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"79e0d68e99bb">Information from Stage 4 (Validation) should b=
e used to prefill the letter automatically based on the reasons for the cha=
llenge and mitigations from the customer.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c6134538-5b16-457a-b77e-62774fe22188">
<td data-local-id=3D"9e9c2e1a-8127-4254-8f7e-06ee7cb187f1" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"d1f37fded095">BR-03</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"aadc9c05-499e-427d-91a5-069fb7d2c670" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6c55b9baf52e">The tool should identify and highlight the cas=
es where the AI cannot complete the letter.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"81ffcac0-9067-4540-9a36-0c576b969c44">
<td data-local-id=3D"551e56ca-f294-4033-8039-6798251bf453" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"cd6d8db98ee0">BR-04</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7aaea139-6bbe-4302-8f59-1a131f527533" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"e6c7b7adaccc">The agent should be able to make changes to a =
case before completing the letter.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"eebfd51a-fa9c-467e-9b95-e709b4cbb17f">
<td data-local-id=3D"b2cd9990-7c01-4a80-b2f6-72c3798f1304" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7b08da213f53">BR-05</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"81a50e23-1463-4d41-9836-66866f432a0a" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"6882340a7db2">The agent should be able to edit the content w=
ithin the letter template.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"3402035cb63a">
<td data-local-id=3D"b333ffe1eff0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"33284aa921f7">BR-06</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"5209dbea3812" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"51d832c23768">If the AI generated letter covers everything (=
Green) then the agent reviews it and clicks complete and automatically tran=
sfer it into the correct template for the relevant CRM.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5e108db23420">
<td data-local-id=3D"8c98f9df64c5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"bb5819ab5d94">BR-07</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"132949aca4a1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"2bfdf1e3556f">The tool needs to identify if an agent has mad=
e an amendment (Amber and Red) to the letter templates and these are, autom=
atically added to the QA work queue for the QAs to check.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"5683e5c1b851">
<td data-local-id=3D"e95860a2-a5fe-4e4a-8941-c25ef22e00f6" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"51deea6c6fb1">BR-08</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"c537066c-600a-4a5a-9363-912b4e2210b9" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4177643fd7c7">If content is added or deleted to a letter tem=
plate by the agent, the amendments needs to be highlighted for the QA to re=
view.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c4999fbbafb9">
<td data-local-id=3D"6231576b-9342-48f0-a128-2a7f5435e863" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"8f1502051892">BR-09</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"b1ee2186-1a13-4203-b6bc-9a9f48205f69" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4c54cc74f260">When a QA sends the letter back with the notes=
 attached on the case, the agent should be able to make the changes before =
sending the letter to the queue for the QA to review as is the current proc=
ess.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b625884b93b5">
<td data-local-id=3D"e85f09b6-893f-4b2d-9308-79635607cc93" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"c2c7cda4077e">BR-10</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"393ec722-cbcc-451e-ac37-c12c7c3f9976" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a001966a68e1">To create a dashboard covering all of the anal=
ysis of the data from the tool and we want this delivered at the same time =
as the solution.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"800db8e53d88">
<td data-local-id=3D"014a6801-4cae-42b8-a036-58f7c54a83c7" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"eb5fd6180eac">BR-11</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"efe7cc18-088a-4e9b-b56c-e90d81a2e8b4" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"7eacf0989ed2">The business to be able to make any changes to=
 Knowledge Source +, and LV to upload the updated knowledge source + docume=
nt to live within 24 hours.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"6e1fe53d7d46">
<td data-local-id=3D"a7041270-f519-4508-8523-6fed80d3c5c1" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"24816f41ae10">BR-12</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"81b69200-3cce-4074-bce6-5b042e9e289f" class=3D"conflue=
nceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9ba6e6e58ea3">The solution shall deliver a streamlined and u=
ser-friendly agent experience, minimising interaction effort and ensuring c=
larity of task expectations.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"8980167a4964">
<td data-local-id=3D"9026c189f5e0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0cedbcd16627">BR-13</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"00d041ca52b5" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a591ad0287b9">A QR code printed on the letter for the custom=
er to be able to scan.</p></td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
</div>
