onseGenerationthirdparty(Non-NoticeIQ)-ProductBacklogDocument(PBD)-7.Assump=
tions"><strong>7. Assumptions</strong></h2>
<ul local-id=3D"cabe65a6-ef95-4eef-beee-1013747ae80c">
<li local-id=3D"29078666-bb00-4228-95e4-7f9236b3610a">
<p local-id=3D"fcc2724e-a2de-4e15-b465-6294c800bd41">Council policy documen=
ts are accessible and up to date.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2fe8dff7-c928-4e00-b827-b9c9c6c88901">
<p local-id=3D"bb93cc72-b714-43cc-8aaf-64e0bd48939c">Agents trained on revi=
ewing the letter before it gets sent out.</p></li>
