onseGenerationthirdparty(Non-NoticeIQ)-ProductBacklogDocument(PBD)-8.Constr=
aints"><strong>8. Constraints</strong></h2>
<ul local-id=3D"a1a278a2-33a7-4088-a6a5-6c9f4f78c1fe">
<li local-id=3D"5e4ee288-c893-4db6-8c0a-152706cb9ad0">
<p local-id=3D"fdaf327d-76fc-40d2-a824-649440353c26">Limited to third party=
 (Non-Notice IQ) contracts.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0c7a66c3-ad77-4872-86cd-ab2d25c40788">
<p local-id=3D"f6a7efd7-519e-4e3a-972b-30f40ad60f7e">Dependent on council d=
ocumentation accuracy.</p></li>
