<h2 local-id=3D"d744c682-7620-46a1-878f-bf80eb8b6cb9" id=3D"Stage5-AutoResp=
onseGenerationthirdparty(Non-NoticeIQ)-ProductBacklogDocument(PBD)-10.Depen=
dencies"><strong>10. Dependencies</strong></h2>
<ul local-id=3D"7c52fb33-ef52-4611-854c-65f69004a408">
<li local-id=3D"df71bfce-67d3-4aa9-a2c4-dad809e94f00">
<p local-id=3D"f62a096b7378"><strong>Stage 5 Tool Integration</strong> -The=
 bot depends on the stage 5 tool being available for retrieving the PCN cas=
e validation (Stage 4 output) into the correspondence letter.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"04626c9d-789c-4cd2-890a-25b8d64a5414">
<p local-id=3D"5fc88e50-e553-49fa-a50b-20ad59bc937a"><strong>Council Policy=
 Documents</strong>-Validation accuracy depends on each council maintaining=
 and providing their up-to-date policy documents.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"fb25f5b7-69a7-4dec-b69a-54e94100aaea">
<p local-id=3D"85792126-e8c7-451b-bc3b-355c50d6a381"><strong>Non-MNPS Porta=
l Access</strong>-Agents must access the tool only through the third party =
(Non-Notice IQ) back-office portal, any downtime impacts adoption.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ca92f7da-d6b5-4935-b4fb-0c26181b8f9e">
<p local-id=3D"e9e802d4-37db-41f0-a9d0-d458a4c44f6e"><strong>User Training<=
/strong>-Processing agents must be trained on reviewing flagged mismatches =
and summaries.</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"2875b652-b096-4ecb-9c0e-0bfb1b0f78da" id=3D"Stage5-AutoResp=
onseGenerationthirdparty(Non-NoticeIQ)-ProductBacklogDocument(PBD)-11.Succe=
ssCriteria"><strong>11. Success Criteria</strong></h2>
<ul local-id=3D"6d8fbdfd-f79e-4e87-bb6d-2bd002ba8962">
<li local-id=3D"1c3d2360-3457-4746-bf17-9fe3b017c57f">
<p local-id=3D"7d75644f-a64b-4fa4-9757-366a551f267c">Consistent validation =
outcomes across councils.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"233a20fa-76cb-4bbc-8c2a-331b9c0bc7dd">
<p local-id=3D"b3473c4a-f05c-4fff-a884-cbc70ae643c1">Positive agent feedbac=
k on usability.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"aaa70d54-862e-4080-9430-6a5275e1cd37">
<p local-id=3D"24646adc-279f-4bba-876f-dce85cde858c">100% audit trail of va=
lidation outcomes.</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"a2488737-d23f-490d-843e-c6d6b960d77d" id=3D"Stage5-AutoResp=
onseGenerationthirdparty(Non-NoticeIQ)-ProductBacklogDocument(PBD)-12.KeyMi=
lestones"><strong>12. Key Milestones</strong></h2>
<ul local-id=3D"89ff55ba-d343-418b-ae1c-a7e267d427f3">
<li local-id=3D"f7b2599b-b3b4-4f9d-aa2e-16002a77614d">
<p local-id=3D"f9b97bf1-0937-496c-bc97-2831e19bc042">Business requirements =
